    "detailed_description": "Hatch eggs, collect dinosaurs, and trade them with friends!<br />\r\nGet free eggs every few hours and trade your extra dinosaurs for more eggs!<br />\r\nYour dinosaur egg will hatch on its own, but you can click on it to make it hatch faster!<br />\r\nView your dinosaur collection in the inventory and display them in-game!<br />\r\nChoose your background to create a picture-perfect environment for your dinosaur!<br />\r\nNew sets of dinosaurs are released periodically!<br />\r\nAre you interested in designing more Dinosaurs?  We will have community-created sets released in the future!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nAchievements<br />\r\ncollectible dinosaurs<br />\r\nSteam inventory integration<br />\r\nCommunity design submissions<br />\r\nNew sets of Dinosaurs released periodically<br />\r\nCustomizable backdrops for creating the perfect environment for your dinosaur<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew features are planned for release soon! Join the community for a sneak peak and to help influence the direction of the game.",
